  "details": "Feature:\n\n- Two separate bio pages:\n\n-  Public Bio: Visible to everyone.\n\n-  Friends-Only Bio: Visible exclusively to friends.\n\nReason/Use-case:\n\n- This feature protects users by allowing them to control sensitive information sharing.\n\n- Example: A user may wish to disclose personal details (e.g., disabilities) to friends but not to the public to avoid harassment or discrimination from malicious users.\n\n- Blocking individuals after an interaction won’t prevent the initial harm, whereas a restricted friends-only bio would help prevent distressing encounters from occurring in the first place.",
